# Keep the build context small and, more importantly, keep secrets and local state OUT of it.
# backend/.env holds the OpenRouter key; it must never reach an image layer. The deployment
# supplies it as a Space secret at runtime instead.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/node_modules/
**/venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

frontend/dist/
frontend/public/board/
frontend/public/pawn/
frontend/public/tickets/
frontend/public/howto/
frontend/public/game_logo.jpg

.git/
.github/
.claude/
.cursor/
docs/adr/
docs/issues/
docs/mechanics/
docs/map/
tools/
**/llm_io_log*.txt
